{"id":"648872","name":"炒卷粿","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/648872/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"卷粿（猪肠粉）","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆芽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜蓉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/648872/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"火腿肠切片备用。","img":"images/648872/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪肠粉切小块。","img":"images/648872/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"绿豆芽洗净备用。","img":"images/648872/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入蒜蓉炒香。","img":"images/648872/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/648872/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽，盐，鸡精。","img":"images/648872/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅拌均匀煮开两三分钟。","img":"images/648872/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"适量淀粉水搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/648872/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煮好的酱汁勾茨后再次煮开即可。","img":"images/648872/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅中热油打入鸡蛋炒香。","img":"images/648872/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入猪肠粉翻炒均匀。","img":"images/648872/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/648872/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色。","img":"images/648872/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入火腿肠翻炒。","img":"images/648872/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入豆芽。","img":"images/648872/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"翻炒均匀至豆芽断生即可。","img":"images/648872/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"炒好的猪肠粉盛入盘中，淋上酱汁洒上葱花，拌匀即可。","img":"images/648872/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648872/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648872/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/648872/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}